  "description": "Build for Umbraco: a Content-section dashboard that shows which build is deployed on this environment and what changed in it. It reads a small build-info.json stamp written by your CI pipeline (build number, commit, branch, pipeline target, and the commits since the previous deployment), shows the environment, the Umbraco version and the versions of the packages that decide how the site behaves, and in development falls back to the local git log. A reference script for Azure DevOps and GitHub Actions is in the repository.",
